        <name>MMC_IPC_RX_INTERRUPT_MASK</name>
          <description>This register maintains the mask for the interrupt generated from the receive IPC statistic counters.
The MMC Receive Checksum Off load Interrupt Mask register maintains the masks for the interrupts generated when the receive IPC (Checksum Off load) statistic counters reach half their maximum value, and when they reach their maximum values. This register is 32 bits wide.</description>
          <addressOffset>0x800</addressOffset>
          <size>32</size>
          <access>read-write</access>
          <resetValue>0x00000000</resetValue>
