          <description>This register is 32-bit valid in eTMR3, and 16-bit in other instances. Since the counter is 32-bit in eTMR3. The default value is 0xFFFFFFFF in eTMR3, 0x0000FFFF in other eTMRs.</description>
          <addressOffset>0x34</addressOffset>
          <size>32</size>
          <access>read-write</access>
